# What `railway up` must not upload.
#
# `.dockerignore` shrinks the *build context* once the files are on Railway;
# this shrinks what leaves your machine in the first place. Without it, a repo
# with a few Claude Code worktrees uploads several hundred MB of virtualenvs
# on every deploy.
.claude/
.venv
**/.venv
.git
logs/
ideas/
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
